..!interpreter english translate noabbrev
..*****************************************************************************
.. FOP-Name       : ARTIKEL.KBUSEL.BN
.. Datum          : 07.11.2006
.. Version        : 2007r0n00
.. Autor          : mh
.. Verantwortlich : mh
.. Kontrolle      : cl
.. Funktion       : Startet eine Selektionsleiste.
..
.. Schnittstelle (Parameter und ihre Bedeutung)
..   verwendet Arrayparameter (arg.i)          : nein
..   verwendet Namensparameter (xpname=wert)   : nein
..
.. Ablauf         : Button-Nach-EFOP fr Button "iskbusel"
..
.. Functionality  : Starts a selection bar.
..
.. Interface (arguments and their meaning)
..   uses array argument (arg.i)           : no
..   uses name argument  (xpname=value)    : no
..
.. Program flow   : After button EFOP for button "iskbusel"
..*****************************************************************************
.set trans -
..
.. the user might abort the selection
.formula M|kbsel = G|false
..
.. use selection bar
.formula G|evtfeldneu  = "%"
.input "is/AUSWAHL"
.continue END        ? M|select = "!"
..
.. set visible flag to show that dynamic selection is being used
.formula M|kbsel = G|true
..
.. remove old rows
.make screen line -- ? M|tzeilen > 0
..
.. clear all 'old' selection params on mask
.formula M|kartvon = ""
.formula M|kartbis = ""
.formula M|keanvon = ""
.formula M|keanbis = ""
.formula M|ksach   = ""
..*****************************************************************************
!END
.continue
